{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InOut is a level based minimalist puzzle platformer that combines mind bending puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with challenging precision platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.poster.avif?t=1768635550\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.webm?t=1768635550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.mp4?t=1768635550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small, yellow creature with two curious eyes. Not knowing where you are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or why you're there, you begin to explore uncovering messages that slowly reveal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the truth about your surroundings and your purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.poster.avif?t=1768635550\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.webm?t=1768635550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.mp4?t=1768635550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >